The .proto files in this repository model data structures specified by IETF
RFCs -- principally RFC 6350 (vCard), RFC 5545 (iCalendar) and RFC 4519
(LDAP schema). Section numbers, property names and short descriptive phrases
are cited from those documents for identification and documentation.

The RFCs themselves are published by the IETF and are subject to the IETF
Trust's Legal Provisions Relating to IETF Documents (BCP 78):

    https://trustee.ietf.org/license-info

Citing them here neither extends this project's Apache-2.0 licence to the RFC
texts nor claims any right in them. The protobuf definitions, their comments
and the surrounding tooling are original work licensed as above.
